Command_Description_Fit             = Fit column widths to full data; use show to restore configured sizing
Command_Description_Hide            = Remove columns from the view
Command_Description_Show            = Add columns, or restore configured sizing with no arguments. End with a bang (!) to clear existing columns first.
Command_Description_Sort            = Sort the items in this view. A bang (!) removes all sorting.
Command_Help_Fit = Fit the requested columns, or all columns, to rendered content. Wide columns may scroll horizontally. Run show without arguments to restore configured sizing.
